  "prototypeNotes": [
    "The ten Background identities are supplied by the catalog rather than duplicated as hardcoded fields.",
    "All Backgrounds begin at 0 and the Character receives five total creation points.",
    "Tribe restrictions are resolved from the selected Tribe entry.",
    "Ordinary experience increases are prohibited by default; changes should occur through explicit narrative or correction operations.",
    "Totem is represented as an individual contribution until the Pack aggregate exists.",
    "Rites Background and Rituals Ability remain separate concepts with no inferred mechanical link.",
    "Chronicle Core remains unaware of all Werewolf Background identities and restrictions."
  ]
